/* 测一测（Figma 651:1365）：搜索 + 人群选择块；按情绪反射弧位置分组的问卷行（题数 + 约 N 分钟）；最近记录。 */
page {
  background: var(--p3-paper);
}

.assessment-page {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-section);
  box-sizing: border-box;
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 16rpx var(--p3-page-x) calc(72rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  background: var(--p3-paper);
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

.assessment-filters {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.assessment-search {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  box-sizing: border-box;
  min-height: 92rpx;
  padding: 0 32rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: var(--p3-surface);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2rpx var(--p3-hairline);
}

.assessment-search__input {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  height: 88rpx;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
}

.assessment-search__placeholder {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
}

.assessment-search__clear {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  width: auto;
  min-height: 72rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-size: 26rpx;
}

.assessment-chips {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.assessment-count {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.assessment-error {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.assessment-section {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
  min-width: 0;
}

.assessment-group {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  padding: 8rpx 36rpx;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-group);
  background: var(--p3-surface);
}

.assessment-row,
.assessment-recent {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 0;
  text-align: left;
}

.assessment-row--disabled {
  opacity: 0.55;
}

.assessment-login {
  flex-direction: row;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  padding: 8rpx 32rpx;
}

.assessment-login__text {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}
